gin":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-13T22:26:48Z","updated_at":"2025-05-13T22:26:48Z","body":"> \n> \n> Do we still have to test it?\n> https://developer.android.com/guide/practices/page-sizes#test\n\nI did a quick test building the Android editor and running it on an Android device, but yes more tests would be good!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2878100581/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2882023886","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106358#issuecomment-2882023886","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106358","id":2882023886,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ryDHO","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-15T02:19:46Z","updated_at":"2025-05-15T02:45:53Z","body":"`adb shell getconf PAGE_SIZE`\r\n\r\nHave you changed your device to 16 KB via developer options?\r\n\r\n----------------\r\n\r\nThere are 4 `Android 15` devices on **Firebase Test Lab**, all running in 4 KB mode.\r\n`Pixel 9 Pro XL, Pixel 9, Lenovo Tab P12, Pixel 8`.\r\n\r\nWe can probably take our time with this (Q4 2025 ?), Android 16 will have a `16 KB page size compatibility mode`\r\nhttps://developer.android.com/about/versions/16/behavior-changes-all#16-kb-compatibility-mode\r\n\r\n\r\nI have a Pixel 8a with Android 15, so I could switch to 16 KB. But that requires a reboot, and I'm currently unsure whether all the apps that are essential in everyday life will run smoothly. I'll continue with an emulator for now; there's a special image for 16KB.\r\n\r\n-------------------\r\n\r\n<details><summary>C++ page_size check (UNIX only)</summary>\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\n#include <unistd.h>\r\n\r\nError Main::setup(const char *execpath, int argc, char *argv[], bool p_second_phase) {\r\n\tThread::make_main_thread();\r\n\tset_current_thread_safe_for_nodes(true);\r\n\r\n    int page_size;\r\n\r\n#ifdef _SC_PAGESIZE\r\n    page_size = sysconf(_SC_PAGESIZE);\r\n#else\r\n    page_size = getpagesize();\r\n#endif\r\n    print_line(\"Main::setup page_size: \", page_size);\r\n```\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2882023886/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2883799678","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106358#issuecomment-2883799678","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106358","id":2883799678,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6r40p-","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-15T13:23:15Z","updated_at":"2025-05-15T13:23:15Z","body":"> Have you changed your device to 16 KB via developer options?\n\n@Alex2782 I also validated the update using the script provided by Google at https://developer.android.com/guide/practices/page-sizes#alignment-use-script.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengin